abstract: >-
  A read-only, metadata-configured reference implementation for checking source
  finding coverage, investigator reviews, recording decisions, AE fields,
  listings, ODM transactions, stored EDC records, and delivery consistency.
  Public examples are fictional. Production qualification and publication terms
  require organizational approval.
keywords:
  - clinical data management
  - adverse events
  - reconciliation
  - traceability
  - metadata

